<title>USA: GFSB Bancorp 1996 net shr up to $0.88.</title>
<headline>GFSB Bancorp 1996 net shr up to $0.88.</headline>
<dateline>GALLUP, New Mexico 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>GFSB Bancorp Inc, the parent holding company of Gallup Federal Savings Bank, said on Monday that net income per share reached $0.88 for the year ended June 30, 55.7 percent more than the $0.57 reported the previous year.</p>
<p>It said net income for the same period totalled $788,000 against $506,000.</p>
</text>
